README 'Проверка': 600 (not 1000) goroutines, 30 000 (not 120 000) fuzz
cases in verify.sh, 13 client fault kinds, 11 corruption kinds / 35 checks
in the harness self-test; machine-dependent and manual measurements marked
as not part of verify.sh; mutation scope stated; exit codes 0/1/3.
AUDIT: --quick is ~30 s and exits 3; VERIFY.log predates the current
verify.sh; 'null in expectations' is not part of verify.sh.

Integration note: merges without textual conflicts with the README/FORMAT changes of proofs
(d9934d5: theorem hypotheses) and of the CC-01 fix (decisions 2 and 7); reviewed by hand.

(cherry picked from commit 565a07cdd8ebb04dd6357d460186b49213bd2196)

